{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "train-libre F-Droid Repo"}, "description": {"en-US": "Automated F-Droid repository for train-libre"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/icon.png", "sha256": "e0809c6a3aaa0bf8d544c1941196b5065fa044a62d3b2d12d47b4d773d72fb5e", "size": 818}}, "address": "https://rfivesix.github.io/train-libre/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1788224569000, "categories": {"Sports & Health": {"name": {"en-US": "Sports & Health"}}}}, "packages": {"com.rfivesix.trainlibre": {"metadata": {"added": 1788224558000, "categories": ["Sports & Health"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre/issues", "lastUpdated": 1788224559000, "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "webSite": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "screenshots": {"phone": {"de-DE": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "53778de29a4e9e78368f065a0c44c505139bbf6e4ea9b36623c1a3a2d501f61e", "size": 421514}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "f3f95322ef3e77b3cd0bab196a0d75035d9810a4d42710df9cd46e7a0b9421d5", "size": 410255}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "185b055532c81a2bbcc78670f911093bb446169ab7bdfb03dc86ae827e20dbb5", "size": 254414}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "fbc7c97c15c3830314080f166b74c0085a616cb1ad4b85521c2356932a75e46e", "size": 211569}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "78b9db2b6a54e2c6d7f6e62509748590a6ef7a8567a57dc46d0482d1e980ca69", "size": 249077}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "d20756985a31663438b48ff6fbe5e3457e81eec609da855c50c386f8971b9472", "size": 1732691}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "7da925444844e75e0b055f91106cfefe351e3949df6e64f39ac3ae3ef53f90a4", "size": 306972}], "en-US": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "50018233fdcb042f110002023ec46fa39bfc31e9907019a17967647173d807f1", "size": 412569}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "33204bd34a371344bb80d14a808c3305e57d932ab93a56c8cf3282db03c4f288", "size": 372976}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "33b96ee3e66d8f4feaa4ea6c0d202c31be33bfef0170915c617ce02fec1e6cc6", "size": 236918}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "b3b1f91ad931b53111d8387c83b8c38ad405d9df7fe5c67e7beb2e139adfd213", "size": 210789}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "5f5f498f17fb5eb53cab1607f1b244d401cc7f798cf6a64d2de6c628a4c1260d", "size": 255613}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "7cd16780775e84362b360328f7db87b04b27b7e5aa2ecd045223b61cb4bfba4f", "size": 1726306}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "edb669e03c3702620b8697f33c713ed7dbca051fddcff6bfee19e468adcaee3c", "size": 288178}]}}, "name": {"en-US": "Train Libre", "de-DE": "Train Libre"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Open-source workout and nutrition tracker with local-first data.", "de-DE": "Open-Source Tracker für Training und Ernährung mit lokalen Daten."}, "description": {"en-US": "Train Libre is an open-source, offline-first fitness tracker for people who want serious training and nutrition logging without giving up control of their data.\n\nFeatures:\n- Log workouts set by set, including warm-ups, working sets, failure sets, dropsets, reps, weight, and RIR\n- Build reusable routines and review completed sessions\n- Track nutrition, meals, hydration, caffeine, creatine, supplements, bodyweight, and body measurements\n- Use progress statistics for PRs, consistency, muscle volume, recovery, body trends, calories, sleep, steps, and pulse where available\n- Keep app data local by default, with export and import for local backups\n- Use integrated Open Food Facts and wger-based catalog sources\n- Export supported app-recorded data one way to Google Health Connect\n- Use optional AI meal features with your own API key, disabled by default\n\nWhat makes Train Libre different:\n- Open source and developed in public\n- Offline-first, with no mandatory cloud account\n- Built for structured gym tracking instead of gamification\n- Transparent analytics designed to be understandable and useful over the long term\n\nTrain Libre is not a medical app. Recovery, sleep, and pulse features are intended for training guidance and personal tracking only and are not medical diagnosis or treatment.\n\nOpen Source:\nThe source code is publicly available and the app is developed in the open.\n", "de-DE": "Train Libre ist ein Open-Source Fitness-Tracker für Menschen, die Training und Ernährung ernsthaft protokollieren wollen, ohne die Kontrolle über ihre Daten abzugeben.\n\nFunktionen:\n- Workouts Satz für Satz protokollieren, inklusive Aufwärmsätzen, Arbeitssätzen, Sätzen bis zum Versagen, Dropsets, Wiederholungen, Gewicht und RIR\n- Routinen erstellen, wiederverwenden und abgeschlossene Einheiten auswerten\n- Ernährung, Mahlzeiten, Hydration, Koffein, Kreatin, Supplements, Körpergewicht und Körpermaße tracken\n- Statistiken für PRs, Konsistenz, Muskelvolumen, Recovery, Körpertrends, Kalorien, Schlaf, Schritte und Puls nutzen, sofern Daten verfügbar sind\n- App-Daten standardmäßig lokal behalten, inklusive Export und Import lokaler Backups\n- Integrierte Datenquellen auf Basis von Open Food Facts und wger verwenden\n- Unterstützte selbst erfasste Daten einseitig zu Google Health Connect exportieren\n- Optionale KI-Mahlzeitenfunktionen mit eigenem API-Key nutzen, standardmäßig deaktiviert\n\nWas Train Libre besonders macht:\n- Open Source und öffentlich entwickelt\n- Offline-first, ohne verpflichtenden Cloud-Account\n- Gebaut für strukturiertes Krafttraining statt Gamification\n- Transparente Analysen, die langfristig verständlich und nützlich bleiben sollen\n\nTrain Libre ist keine medizinische App. Recovery-, Schlaf- und Pulsfunktionen dienen der Trainingsplanung und persönlichen Orientierung und stellen keine medizinische Diagnose oder Behandlung dar.\n\nOpen Source:\nDer Quellcode ist öffentlich verfügbar und die App wird offen entwickelt.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}, "de-DE": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}}, "preferredSigner": "7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"}, "versions": {"a76ed7f618416fa3afddcb8fe7ccf8e9e07b6078550dbdaac768fe2bf241b18e": {"added": 1788224559000, "file": {"name": "/app-x86_64-release.apk", "sha256": "a76ed7f618416fa3afddcb8fe7ccf8e9e07b6078550dbdaac768fe2bf241b18e", "size": 40185756}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["x86_64"], "versionName": "1.2.1", "versionCode": 1006018, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 32}, {"name": "android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 28}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_PROMOTED_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_STEPS"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_SLEEP"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.READ_HEART_RATE"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_WEIGHT"}, {"name": "android.permission.health.WRITE_BODY_FAT"}, {"name": "android.permission.healt