egardless of goal or calorie budget and gave every remaining calorie to carbohydrates — the very bottom of the evidence-based cutting range (0.5–1.0 g/kg) and below the maintenance range (0.8–1.2 g/kg). Fat is now targeted per kilogram like protein already was: **0.9 g/kg while cutting, 1.0 g/kg at maintenance an", "de-DE": "\n### Changed\n- **Fat Recommendation Raised off its Floor (`AdaptiveNutritionRecommendationEngine`, #252):** The adaptive recommendation set fat to a flat floor of 0.60 g/kg body weight regardless of goal or calorie budget and gave every remaining calorie to carbohydrates — the very bottom of the evidence-based cutting range (0.5–1.0 g/kg) and below the maintenance range (0.8–1.2 g/kg). Fat is now targeted per kilogram like protein already was: **0.9 g/kg while cutting, 1.0 g/kg at maintenance an"}}}}}}